# VS Code
# The folder holds launch configurations and tasks. Nothing under it has ever
# been committed here (`git ls-files` returns none), so ignoring it takes
# nothing out of version control. This replaces a `.vs_code/` rule that never
# matched anything -- the directory VS Code actually writes is `.vscode/`.
.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
build/

